1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,860
Keyword: Temporary Levels

2
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:06,640
Temporary Levels are
non-permanent level bonuses.

3
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:11,040
They disappear after the battle ends.

4
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:14,320
Some hero effects, talents
and effect cards

5
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:16,840
can grant Temporary Levels.

6
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:20,900
Want to keep those levels?
Try Ming.

7
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:25,960
His card effect converts some
Temporary Levels into permanent ones.

8
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:31,127
Make good use of this temporary power.
It can be the key to winning.
